  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Reach Your Goal Safely and Efficiently </h1>",
      "body": "<p><strong>With ZOLLER’s »powerShrink«,« shrink-fitted tools are ready for use in no time: thanks to the intuitive »pilot« software, the intelligent induction system, and continuous monitoring of the steps.</strong></p> <p>The »powerShrink« technology ensures the shortest possible process cycles. Even inexperienced operators can achieve the resulting short process times after just a brief training period. The »pilot« operating software guides you through all steps and controls many processes fully automatically. For each step, the software displays the component required and provides visual support through graphic displays on the screen and the pioneering ZOLLER »actbyLight« user guidance concept—the light-guided user guidance designed for the safe and efficient use of »the« »powerShrink« in your company.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "center",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c1145",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "none",
       "after": "none"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "slider",
      "header": "",
      "slides": [
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/c/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_01_1d67bafda1.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Use the shrink fit holder; select the heating parameters (manual/automatic via »»idChip««)</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/2/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_02_7fbe9ad14e.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Shielding system: Use the disc or »»varOct«« (manual/motorized) for alignment</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/3/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_03_59a29571d3.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Move the coil down until it rests on the shrink fit holder</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/2/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_04_d1d6b10cb5.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Start the heating process; the heating progress is represented in the software</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/4/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_05_6a89d57efc.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>After the heating process, raise the coil and use the cutting tool in the shrink fit holder</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/1/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_06_c67d071d45.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Slide the mount onto the green-flashing cooling bell and place it on top</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/c/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_07_243a8d8b98.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>The cooling process starts automatically; when it ends, a blue light is displayed</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/8/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_08_eaa3a6241a.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>After the cooling process is complete, remove the cooling bell from the shrink fit holder</p>"
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "zoller_slider",
      "id": "c2249",
      "bg": "white",
      "space": {
       "before": "none",
       "after": "none"
      }
     }
    ]
