   }
  },
  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h2> Clearly managed and perfectly connected </h2>",
      "body": "<p>The clearly structured graphic interface of the ZOLLER »pilot« software guides operators intuitively and reliably step by step through the input dialog using large function buttons and a well-designed color scheme. The 12.5-inch monitor delivers a razor-sharp representation.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "center",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c1207",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "slider",
      "header": "",
      "slides": [
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/a/csm_pilot_software_home_7c48c5a9b8.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Main Menu </strong>– large function areas with clear figures: Shrink-fit chuck selection, parameter selection, or scan code.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/e/csm_pilot_software_01_9cf8a9b735.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Parameter Selection</strong> – The required heating parameters can be selected simply and reliably using clear and intuitive software interfaces.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/4/csm_pilot_software_02_804c34930c.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Scan Function</strong> – All parameters corresponding to the shrink fit holder are loaded automatically, regardless of the manufacturer. Monitoring of the number of heating cycles and viewing of information for each shrink fit holder is possible.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/9/csm_pilot_software_03_ce773da547.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>S<strong>tep-by-Step Guidance</strong> – Throughout the entire shrinking process, »pilot« displays the exact step to perform and when.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/4/csm_pilot_software_04_1b1ee4dc49.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Status Displays</strong> – Whether heating or cooling, »pilot« shows you the process progress and important safety instructions at all times.</p>"
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "zoller_slider",
